the oncogene is presented on the right part (&#x025aa;). <bold>B</bold>: The control sequence is the sequence #5 with four mismatches. Mismatch site is shown in boxes. <bold>C</bold>: Structure of the shRNA1 and negative control shRNA.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="gkn882f1"/></fig></p></body></article>